(998, 'de', '38b88eb7ef1164fc29e554474faa08bb965d566c', '<p>Tech Trend makes keyboards, keycaps and desk gear in small runs, warehoused in the EU.</p><h2>How we work</h2><p>Replace this with your story.</p>', '<p>Tech Trend stellt Tastaturen, Tastenkappen und Schreibtischausrüstung in kleinen Auflagen her, die in der EU gelagert werden.</p><p>Wie wir arbeiten </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ersetzen Sie dies durch Ihre Geschichte.</p>', 0, '2026-09-29 20:11:08', '2026-09-29 20:11:08'),
(999, 'nl', '38b88eb7ef1164fc29e554474faa08bb965d566c', '<p>Tech Trend makes keyboards, keycaps and desk gear in small runs, warehoused in the EU.</p><h2>How we work</h2><p>Replace this with your story.</p>', '<p>Tech Trend maakt toetsenborden, keycaps en bureaustoelen in kleine oplages, ondergebracht in de EU.</p><p>Hoe wij werken</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Vervang dit door jouw verhaal.</p>', 0, '2026-09-29 20:11:13', '2026-09-29 20:11:13'),
(1000, 'fr', '38b88eb7ef1164fc29e554474faa08bb965d566c', '<p>Tech Trend makes keyboards, keycaps and desk gear in small runs, warehoused in the EU.</p><h2>How we work</h2><p>Replace this with your story.</p>', '<p>Tech Trend fabrique des claviers, des touches et du matériel de bureau en petites séries, entreposés dans l\'UE.</p><p>Comment nous travaillons</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Remplacez ceci par votre histoire.</p>', 0, '2026-09-29 20:11:19', '2026-09-29 20:11:19'),
(1001, 'sv', '38b88eb7ef1164fc29e554474faa08bb965d566c', '<p>Tech Trend makes keyboards, keycaps and desk gear in small runs, warehoused in the EU.</p><h2>How we work</h2><p>Replace this with your story.</p>', '<p>Tech Trend tillverkar tangentbord, tangentkapslar och skrivbordsutrustning i små serier, lagrade i EU.</p><p>Hur vi arbetar</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ersätt detta med din berättelse.</p>', 0, '2026-09-29 20:11:23', '2026-09-29 20:11:23'),
(1002, 'pl', '38b88eb7ef1164fc29e554474faa08bb965d566c', '<p>Tech Trend makes keyboards, keycaps and desk gear in small runs, warehoused in the EU.</p><h2>How we work</h2><p>Replace this with your story.</p>', '<p>Tech Trend produkuje klawiatury, klawiatury i sprzęt biurkowy w małych seriach, magazynowane w UE.</p><p>Jak pracujemy</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Zastąp to swoją historią.</p>', 0, '2026-09-29 20:11:28', '2026-09-29 20:11:28'),
(1003, 'de', 'fdc0f539869be8c6a759e2a3a51e0d6f2434e7ed', '<p>Questions about an order, a layout, or a team purchase? Send us a message and we usually reply within one working day.</p>', '<p>Fragen zu einer Bestellung, einem Layout oder einem Teamkauf? Senden Sie uns eine Nachricht und wir antworten in der Regel innerhalb eines Werktages.</p>', 0, '2026-09-29 20:11:34', '2026-09-29 20:11:34'),
