(1, 'header', '{\"nav\": [{\"href\": \"/collections/keyboards\", \"label\": \"Keyboards\", \"children\": []}, {\"href\": \"/collections/keycaps\", \"label\": \"Keycaps\", \"children\": []}, {\"href\": \"/collections/apparel\", \"label\": \"Apparel\", \"children\": []}, {\"href\": \"/collections/desk-mats\", \"label\": \"Desk\", \"children\": []}, {\"href\": \"/blog\", \"label\": \"Blog\", \"children\": []}], \"logo_path\": null, \"brand_name\": \"Tech Trend\", \"announcements\": [\"Free shipping over $75\", \"Dispatched from Leipzig\", \"30-day returns, prepaid label\"], \"search_placeholder\": \"Search products\"}', '2026-09-16 05:00:01', '2026-09-29 20:15:32'),
(2, 'hero', '{\"delay\": 6000, \"slides\": [{\"id\": \"default-1\", \"text\": \"Keyboards, keycaps and desk things in small runs. Warehoused in the EU, priced with VAT already in the number.\", \"title\": \"Gear for people who read the docs.\", \"eyebrow\": \"Autumn drop 06 — Shipping now\", \"image_path\": \"hero/0Tvthsz4PeEkJUqGTIhsbI3CFtU1afgGdEjESDSV.jpg\", \"primary_href\": \"/keyboards\", \"primary_label\": \"Shop now\", \"secondary_href\": \"/products/compile-75\", \"secondary_label\": \"See the Compile 75\"}, {\"id\": \"960d8d2a-855c-4fc2-b226-c3c062775bba\", \"text\": \"Keyboards, keycaps and desk things in small runs. Warehoused in the EU, priced with VAT already in the number.\", \"title\": \"Slide 2 for people who read the docs.\", \"eyebrow\": \"Autumn drop 06 — Shipping now\", \"image_path\": null, \"primary_href\": \"/keyboards\", \"primary_label\": \"Shop now\", \"secondary_href\": \"/products/compile-75\", \"secondary_label\": \"See the Compile 75\"}], \"autoplay\": true}', '2026-09-17 05:43:31', '2026-09-17 05:43:31'),
(3, 'promos', '{\"cards\": [{\"id\": \"default-1\", \"href\": \"/last-call\", \"text\": \"Final units of run 04 and 05, at run-price.\", \"label\": \"Shop now\", \"title\": \"Last-call runs\", \"image_path\": \"promos/7GpARFXFBOIsBPiZdr6IqmEpjVkETSSyVpvx3W12.jpg\", \"box_position\": \"bottom-left\"}, {\"id\": \"default-2\", \"href\": \"/build\", \"text\": \"Case, plate, switches, caps — configured in one page.\", \"label\": \"Configure\", \"title\": \"Build your own\", \"image_path\": \"promos/ubW0tMcKQQu3uL3kc6xc3S18gSZFB2oNLigdRKjN.jpg\", \"box_position\": \"top-left\"}, {\"id\": \"default-3\", \"href\": \"/team-orders\", \"text\": \"Branded caps and mats, invoicing, one delivery.\", \"label\": \"Get a quote\", \"title\": \"Team orders\", \"image_path\": \"promos/NKKq2gGpPRW0ddm5tO0qFjvRvoRzw9jO8iUgLV4b.jpg\", \"box_position\": \"top-left\"}]}', '2026-09-18 05:07:21', '2026-09-18 05:07:21'),
(4, 'explore', '{\"cards\": [{\"id\": \"explore-1\", \"href\": \"/run-06\", \"text\": \"The colourway that sold out twice, back once.\", \"label\": \"Explore now\", \"title\": \"Run 06 in Indigo\", \"image_path\": \"explore/99Fr5bmzdCvItO3mDkF7KRozXG497d4kkWtBi6bo.jpg\", \"box_position\": \"bottom-left\"}, {\"id\": \"explore-2\", \"href\": \"/layouts\", \"text\": \"ISO-DE, UK, Nordic and AZERTY kits in stock.\", \"label\": \"Explore now\", \"title\": \"Build your layout\", \"image_path\": \"explore/XtquT9VsnNieo1mc1h0BsW4CSMNrRmdKxDz8xdlf.jpg\", \"box_position\": \"bottom-left\"}, {\"id\": \"explore-3\", \"href\": \"/desk\", \"text\": \"Mats, cables and trays that match the board.\", \"label\": \"Explore now\", \"title\": \"Desk, finished\", \"image_path\": \"explore/ZIkpU7c1KpYpDUgc8O88SHiGMH13zOrLMHlmgORF.jpg\", \"box_position\": \"bottom-left\"}]}', '2026-09-18 05:32:53', '2026-09-18 05:45:23'),
(5, 'cta', '{\"href\": \"/reserve\", \"text\": \"400 units, four colourways, one production window. Reservations open to the list first.\", \"label\": \"Join the list\", \"stats\": [{\"label\": \"countries served, duties prepaid\", \"value\": \"31\"}, {\"label\": \"median delivery\", \"value\": \"2.4d\"}, {\"label\": \"desks running our caps\", \"value\": \"18,400\"}, {\"label\": \"return rate, measured\", \"value\": \"1.9%\"}], \"title\": \"Reserve the next drop before it exists.\", \"enabled\": true, \"eyebrow\": \"Run 07 — Opens 3 October\"}', '2026-09-20 05:02:54', '2026-09-20 05:03:02'),
(6, 'blog', '{\"count\": 4, \"title\": \"From the workshop\", \"enabled\": true, \"subtitle\": \"Build logs, layout guides and the occasional teardown.\"}', '2026-09-20 05:28:46', '2026-09-20 05:28:46'),
(7, 'footer', '{\"badges\": [\"Card\", \"PayPal\", \"Klarna\", \"SEPA\"], \"columns\": [{\"links\": [{\"href\": \"/collections/switches\", \"label\": \"Switches\"}, {\"href\": \"/collections/keycaps\", \"label\": \"Keycaps\"}, {\"href\": \"/collections/apparel\", \"label\": \"Apparel\"}, {\"href\": \"/collections/desk-mats\", \"label\": \"Desk Mats\"}], \"title\": \"Shop\"}, {\"links\": [{\"href\": \"/shipping\", \"label\": \"Shipping & duties\"}, {\"href\": \"/returns\", \"label\": \"Returns\"}, {\"href\": \"/about\", \"label\": \"About Us\"}, {\"href\": \"/contact\", \"label\": \"Contact\"}], \"title\": \"Help\"}, {\"links\": [{\"href\": \"/terms\", \"label\": \"Terms\"}, {\"href\": \"/privacy\", \"label\": \"Privacy (GDPR)\"}, {\"href\": \"/cookies\", \"label\": \"Cookies\"}, {\"href\": \"/withdrawal\", \"label\": \"Right of withdrawal\"}], \"title\": \"Legal\"}], \"copyright\": \"© {year} Tech Trend BV. All rights reserved.\", \"description\": \"Small-run desk gear, shipped from Rotterdam & Leipzig.\\nTech Trend BV · VAT NL-8256.31.004.B01\"}', '2026-09-29 20:13:38', '2026-09-29 20:14:58'),
(8, 'cookie_banner', '{\"text\": \"We use cookies for the bag, the region you picked, and anonymous traffic counts. Analytics only with your consent.\", \"enabled\": true, \"version\": 2, \"position\": \"bottom\", \"categories\": {\"analytics\": {\"label\": \"Analytics\", \"enabled\": true, \"description\": \"Anonymous visit counts that help us improve the shop.\"}, \"marketing\": {\"label\": \"Marketing\", \"enabled\": false, \"description\": \"Measuring ads and showing relevant offers on other sites.\"}}, \"save_label\": \"Save choices\", \"policy_href\": \"/cookies\", \"accept_label\": \"Accept all\", \"policy_label\": \"Cookie policy\", \"reject_label\": \"Essential only\", \"customize_label\": \"Settings\", \"essential_label\": \"Essential\", \"plausible_domain\": null, \"ga_measurement_id\": null, \"essential_description\": \"Your bag, language, region and login. Always on, because the shop cannot work without them.\"}', '2026-09-30 20:06:32', '2026-09-30 20:07:09'),
(9, 'product_rows', '{\"rows\": [{\"id\": \"popular\", \"limit\": 8, \"title\": \"Popular this week\", \"source\": \"newest\", \"enabled\": true, \"subtitle\": \"What people put in the bag most often.\", \"link_href\": \"/products\", \"placement\": \"before_explore\", \"link_label\": \"View all products\", \"product_ids\": [], \"collection_slug\": null}, {\"id\": \"trending\", \"limit\": 8, \"title\": \"Trending on desks\", \"source\": \"top_rated\", \"enabled\": true, \"subtitle\": \"Fresh out of the latest run.\", \"link_href\": null, \"placement\": \"after_explore\", \"link_label\": null, \"product_ids\": [], \"collection_slug\": null}, {\"id\": \"4f6949a6-76cd-4da5-85aa-d77691ed0848\", \"limit\": 8, \"title\": \"Team orders\", \"source\": \"manual\", \"enabled\": true, \"subtitle\": null, \"link_href\": \"/collections/desk-mats\", \"placement\": \"after_explore\", \"link_label\": \"View all Team orders\", \"product_ids\": [8, 10, 9, 1, 6], \"collection_slug\": null}]}', '2026-10-01 19:51:17', '2026-10-01 19:51:17'),
(10, 'seo', '{\"returns\": {\"days\": 30, \"free\": true}, \"indexing\": true, \"site_name\": \"Laravel\", \"organization\": {\"city\": \"New Delhi\", \"email\": \"hello@laravel.test\", \"phone\": \"+91 11 4000 0000\", \"street\": \"12 Demo Street, Connaught Place\", \"country\": \"IN\", \"same_as\": [\"https://www.instagram.com/laravel\", \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/laravel\", \"https://x.com/laravel\", \"https://www.youtube.com/@laravel\"], \"postcode\": \"110001\", \"legal_name\": \"Laravel Pvt. Ltd.\"}, \"default_image\": \"seo/default-share.png\", \"twitter_handle\": \"@laravel\", \"bing_verification\": null, \"default_description\": \"Limited-run tech accessories and desk gear, made in small batches. Secure checkout, fast delivery and 30-day free returns at Laravel.\", \"google_verification\": null}', '2026-10-19 20:29:14', '2026-10-19 20:30:54');
